# Docker context exclusions for the frontend image.
#
# The patterns here MUST be recursive. `.env*` only matches at the context root, so the single
# dot form silently let backend/.env and META-WHATSAPP-API-KIT/.env (live Meta credentials) into
# the build context, and therefore into an image layer via `COPY . .`.

**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
**/.env*
!**/.env.example
**/*.example

# Build output and caches
**/.next
**/.next-stale
**/out
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.turbo
**/.cache
coverage

# VCS and CI
.git
.gitignore
.github

# Repositories nested inside this one (each needs its own build, not the parent's)
backend
desktop
META-WHATSAPP-API-KIT
backup

# Local tooling and agent config
.agents
.claude
.cursor
.vscode
.idea

# Platform metadata
.vercel
.firebaserc

# Logs and scratch output
*.log
**/*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
firestore-debug.log

# Docs that must never ship inside the image
FULL-AUDIT-REPORT.md
proposal-feature-audit.md
*.md
!**/README.md